  "title": "Duke Energy honors lineworkers who help strengthen grid, restore power",
  "summary": "On April 18, Duke Energy recognizes National Lineworker Appreciation Day and the lineworkers who keep the lights on. From year-round grid work that improves reliability to storm response, lineworkers bring skill, teamwork and a strong safety focus to the work customers depend on.",
